fty ,$ these solutions approach infinity as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nAmong the given options, the only phase portrait satisfying these conditions is the following:\n\n![](images/37/3784f65f97466e17d857a66ca17e69173de72e9608111c839e989cfff3fe10e0.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420020 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166912 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d5802583-df2c-5f08-bf9f-8b36247e34d4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Phase Portrait of a System"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05b17d17-ec55-5e3f-b45a-f45e69858205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/cd/cd695b56546593518654320ec7220ef4672d428592bb271b6f4a9fe5ad649cdf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419959} {:answer/id #uuid "1c5311f1-f33e-50da-9c1d-521aee7b5b70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/40/40fa7149639fce8388e4eedace5eaab60f38a4a43eca8367289cf6e1f8c0d25e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419961} {:answer/id #uuid "29fe869b-63d9-585e-af7f-982e25668441" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b0/b01e4797a3de37e4fd92596b97c7736a066813d71f08a2c8282e70a5f597272d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419964} {:answer/id #uuid "876c7253-d60c-55be-9912-91c2e1235fbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e9/e9fa4226361b8c0abe6c5b02374967b025aa8870757150f86b15434841825e2d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419977} {:answer/id #uuid "aa7618f2-5fac-5ea0-beaa-eb999609c34e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/41/41c2c33cd066a2350cb81f6a6b460c880e429ed6f9bb9901a18e06e3c61d0ae0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419982}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "876c7253-d60c-55be-9912-91c2e1235fbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/